SUMMARY:Stand-Up Showcase
LOCATION:Washington
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy great stand-up comedy in downtown DC. Our showcase lineup
 s feature top talent from DC\, Maryland\, Virginia and beyond\, performing 
 on one of the country's most famous stages. You'll see a variety of styles 
 and get up close with some of the stars of tomorrow. Support local talent\,
  support local business and (most important) laugh your a** off. Showcases 
 generally last around 90 minutes.\n\nOctober 9-11 lineup: John Jacobs\, Den
 ise Taylor\, Ontonio Kareem\, Bob Holden\n\nOctober 16-18 lineup: Anthony O
 akes\, Joey Duffied\, Abe Gatling\, Prince Arora\n\nAll sales are final. Re
 funds and exchanges are offered only when a show is canceled or rescheduled
 .\n\nAdmission Policies\n\nPatrons must be 18 or older to attend events or 
 classes at the DC Improv. Any exceptions are clearly noted in the event des
 criptions.\n\nThere is a two-item minimum per customer. This can be any com
 bination of food items or beverages. Bottled water and soft drinks count as
  items. (The two-item minimum does not apply to comedy classes.)\n\nCoupons
  or passes for free admission cannot be used for a show listed as a "specia
 l event."\n\nSeating Policies\n\nAll shows in our lounge showroom are seate
 d by time of arrival. The earlier you arrive\, the more options you'll have
 . Please note that the size of your party can affect what options are avail
 able to you\, as certain tables and areas are designated for larger parties
 .\n\nFor general admission tickets\, if your party does not fill an entire 
 table\, you may be sharing a table with other patrons.\nMore info: https://
 comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/stand-up-showcase-33145/
URL:https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/stand-up-showcase-33145/
